      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Block by avatar ID and or avatar creator is still one of the highly requested features that could rectify some of the excessive cloning issues. If I am in a public and randoms start cloning cancerous avatars I would love to be able to just block the avatar ID. While I have not seen any \"raids\" recently I have seen plenty of times lots of people just cloning cancerous avatars for fun. It gets difficult and tedious to continuously hide avatars as people clone it.",
