  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Avatar cloning has been more of a problem than a blessing.  Not only is it creating not only an uncreative atmosphere, it is creating a lot of unoriginality in our community.  It has also rendered avatar worlds useless without people giving proper credit to avatar authors.  Lastly, I feel like the amount of players that start playing the game from the very get-go get cancerous avatars and cause more problems before they even have a chance to try the game, which dampens other players' experience at the same time.",
